ok - machine dispatch is a durable inbox request
ok - request identity and acknowledgment survive retries
ok - concurrent submissions and lost announcements keep one durable identity
ok - invalid kinds, missing fields, unsafe framing, and unknown fields are refused
ok - secondmate relays notice and keyed blocker exactly once before acknowledgment
